---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import DayRating from '../../rateDay/rateDay.astro'

export const post = {
  day: 3,
  title: 'Day 3',
  date: '2026-09-09',
  description: 'Forth day, of daily',
  category: 'Daily',
  tags: ['Astro', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Web Development'],
}
---

<Layout>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 pt-32">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
        <span
          class="font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--secondary)]"
        >
          {post.category}
        </span>

        <span class="text-[var(--border)]">/</span>

        <span class="text-[var(--muted)]">
          Day {post.day}
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
      >
        {post.title}
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
        {
          new Date(post.date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
            day: 'numeric',
            month: 'long',
            year: 'numeric',
          })
        }
      </p>

      <p
        class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--secondary)] pl-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--muted)] sm:text-xl"
      >
        {post.description}
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-14 leading-8">
      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          What I did today?
        </h2>
       <p>         
Today,I did my habit but  I spent almost whole day in work, earlier I watched "You" with my dad (on Netflix). As I wrote yesterday I listened new audiobook "think and bogać się" It was really one of the best books I listened, I'll probably buy paper version, to read it by myself and probably not once, This book is focused on achieving your goals, and what u need to do to make everything possible, for example u need a goal to achieve without goal and time to reach it you won't reach it as fast as you want If you'd even reach it
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section class="py-5">
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        Plans for tomorrow
      </h2>

      <p>
        I'll wake up early. I'll make my bed. I'll drink glass of water (my
        habbits from mindfulness), I'll read part of book "think faster, talk
        smarter",I'll go to work and I'll listen audiobooks, I'll find audiobook
        to listen, and wrote blog about this (the same plan as yesterday)
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        How I rate this day
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p>
          I'll give 8/10, I did everything I planed and I couldn't do much more
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <DayRating class="w-full" rating={8} />
  </article>
</Layout>
